            {
                "parameters": {
                    "promptType": "define",
                    "text": "=You are a career professional, who can help me to create a list of my achievements based on my previous work experience and the job I am applying for. You have to create a list of relevant achievements and output it in this json format:\n{\n\"achievements\":[\n{\n\"description\": \"a detailed description of my achievement that highlichts why I am perfect for the job I am applying for\",\n\"company\": \"the name of the company, where I achieved this achievement\",\n\"reason\": \"the reason why you think this would be an achievement I should add to my resume\"\n}\n]\n\nThe definition of an achievement: \n\nThey are general accomplishments across my roles, education, or life. They can include things like: \n\"Completed a certification in cloud computing.\"\n\"Organized team events that improved morale.\"\n\nThey have to be relevant to the job I am applying for. Highly relevant achievements will be rewarded.\nYou also must not add any achievements I already have in my list. The achievements already on my list are: {{ $json.achievements.map(a => a.description) }}\n\nthe description of the job I am applying for:\n\"{{ $json.applications[0].content }}\"\n\nmy job experience summarized in my own words and formatted into a json structure, where the property \"from\" represents the month and year I started the job, the property \"to\" represents the month and year I quit the job, the property \"description\" represents the description of the job, what I did and what I achieved,\nthe property \"company\" represents the name of the company, the property \"location\" represents the name of the city I worked in, and the property \"title\" represents the official position I had at this job: \n\n\"{{ $json.jobs.toJsonString() }}\"\n\nYou have to output only the json and nothing else. Adding additional text that would prevent me from parsing the json will result in a penalty.",
                    "hasOutputParser": true,
                    "options": {}
                },
                "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
                "typeVersion": 1.8,
                "position": [
